From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:11:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3282/3799] soh: rename D_80AE4918 -> sUnusedWalkPos

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: copied into a local EnRd_WalkToPlayer never reads; the copy is all that survives of whatever effect it fed
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c
index 81bceb6bc..04a078d95 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c
@@ -106,7 +106,8 @@ static InitChainEntry sInitChain[] = {
     ICHAIN_F32_DIV1000(gravity, -3500, ICHAIN_STOP),
 };
 
-static Vec3f D_80AE4918 = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_80AE4918: copied into a local EnRd_WalkToPlayer never reads; the copy is all that survives of whatever effect it fed
+static Vec3f sUnusedWalkPos = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };  // was D_80AE4918 [LLM:GUESS]
 
 // I'm guessing these are primitive and environment colors that go unused
 static Color_RGBA8 D_80AE4924 = { 200, 200, 255, 255 };
@@ -316,7 +317,7 @@ void EnRd_SetupWalkToPlayer(EnRd* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void EnRd_WalkToPlayer(EnRd* this, PlayState* play) {
-    Vec3f sp44 = D_80AE4918;
+    Vec3f sp44 = sUnusedWalkPos;  // was D_80AE4918 [LLM:GUESS]
     Color_RGBA8 sp40 = D_80AE4924;
     Color_RGBA8 sp3C = D_80AE4928;
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
